WEBVTT

00:00:09.615 --> 00:00:14.245
Hatenkou Yugi

00:00:15.320 --> 00:00:18.556
Tabidachi wa sone totsuzen

00:00:18.557 --> 00:00:22.027
Guzen no yona hitsuzen

00:00:22.027 --> 00:00:27.829
Mawari dashita unmei ga kishimu

00:00:28.901 --> 00:00:32.268
Totsuzen no ame ni sozen

00:00:32.437 --> 00:00:35.706
Furarete zubunure bozen

00:00:35.707 --> 00:00:41.805
Warai tobase michi wa hirakareru

00:00:42.447 --> 00:00:45.616
Muimi na koto ni kakusareteru

00:00:45.617 --> 00:00:49.187
Ichiban daiji na mono wa nani

00:00:49.187 --> 00:00:57.094
Kitto kiseki wa okosu mono waratte

00:00:57.763 --> 00:01:00.596
My Heartbreaking Romance

00:01:00.799 --> 00:01:04.836
Hajikeyo omou mama ni

00:01:04.836 --> 00:01:10.138
Omoshiro yukai sore ga kihon

00:01:11.043 --> 00:01:14.171
Kimi no Heartrending Sorrow

00:01:14.479 --> 00:01:18.416
Ima wa mada furenai yo

00:01:18.417 --> 00:01:24.879
Mazu wa koko kara hajimeyo

00:01:25.157 --> 00:01:29.992
Am | ever

00:01:32.264 --> 00:01:35.597
That day, Alzeid asked me.

00:01:36.034 --> 00:01:38.628
Have you even been betrayed?

00:01:39.471 --> 00:01:45.239
Have you ever been abandoned
by someone you trusted, with no explanation?

00:01:47.512 --> 00:01:48.536
No.

00:01:50.916 --> 00:01:52.508
But the truth is...

00:01:53.418 --> 00:01:55.147
Let’s play tag.

00:01:55.687 --> 00:01:59.054
Don’t cross this line until | tell you to.

00:02:00.959 --> 00:02:02.790
Okay, I'll be waiting.

00:02:03.795 --> 00:02:05.854
...| knew he wouldn't come back for me.

00:02:06.598 --> 00:02:08.031
| wouldn’t cry.

00:02:08.700 --> 00:02:10.292
Okay, I'll be waiting...

00:02:11.269 --> 00:02:13.134
| wouldn’t say that | don’t want him to go.

00:02:13.872 --> 00:02:16.534
| would never say it.

00:02:31.156 --> 00:02:32.088
Are you by yourself?

00:02:32.357 --> 00:02:34.154
Did you get separated from your mommy?

00:02:40.766 --> 00:02:44.668
A Silent Song of Lullaby

00:02:51.543 --> 00:02:53.909
Wow, so many people!

00:02:55.313 --> 00:02:56.439
How annoying.

00:02:56.715 --> 00:02:58.910
C’mon, you need to take your mind off things.

00:02:59.284 --> 00:03:00.751
Look, balloons.

00:03:04.589 --> 00:03:05.351
Here.

00:03:05.657 --> 00:03:06.624
Thanks.

00:03:07.025 --> 00:03:10.161
Oh sorry, did you want one too, Alzeid?

00:03:10.162 --> 00:03:11.959
Hurry up and find his parents.

00:03:12.497 --> 00:03:16.534
Alright, let’s begin operation “Search for his mother
by riding on the blunt horse!”

00:03:16.535 --> 00:03:17.669
What was that?

00:03:17.669 --> 00:03:20.797
Have you seen this boy’s mother?

00:03:21.173 --> 00:03:22.936
Um... What’s your name?

00:03:23.175 --> 00:03:24.107
Romario!

00:03:25.777 --> 00:03:26.611
Mommy!

00:03:26.611 --> 00:03:30.377
Romario! My goodness.
| was so worried about you.

00:03:30.716 --> 00:03:33.118
Don’t let go of my hand again. Okay?

00:03:33.118 --> 00:03:33.607
Okay.

00:03:34.052 --> 00:03:36.919
That’s right. | shouldn’t have let go.

00:03:40.292 --> 00:03:42.327
I’m sorry for causing you so much trouble.

00:03:42.327 --> 00:03:45.063
It’s alright. I’m just glad he found his mother.

00:03:45.063 --> 00:03:47.198
Is there any way | can repay you?

00:03:47.199 --> 00:03:51.158
Don’t worry. We were just looking
for someone as well.

00:03:51.369 --> 00:03:54.167
By the way, aren’t you
going somewhere yourselves?

00:03:54.406 --> 00:03:57.976
Yes, he wanted to see the circus.

00:03:57.976 --> 00:04:00.945
C-circus? Where is it?

00:04:28.173 --> 00:04:29.240
Wow!

00:04:29.241 --> 00:04:30.435
How amazing!

00:04:30.709 --> 00:04:32.744
I’m glad | was able to repay you
by inviting you along.

00:04:32.744 --> 00:04:34.912
I’m sorry for imposing on your kindness like this.

00:04:34.913 --> 00:04:36.938
Look, the next one is starting!

00:05:36.608 --> 00:05:38.509
In the presence of this lovely lady,

00:05:38.510 --> 00:05:43.812
even these deadly knives will turn
into beautiful roses instantaneously.

00:05:44.015 --> 00:05:44.947
Huh?

00:05:46.351 --> 00:05:47.648
Baroqueheat!

00:05:52.424 --> 00:05:54.392
Are you enjoying yourself, Rahzel-chan?

00:05:54.392 --> 00:05:55.793
Good grief, Heat-tan...

00:05:55.794 --> 00:05:59.491
just when I’m wondering what kind of work
you're doing, | find you clowning around.

00:05:59.764 --> 00:06:03.029
In the past, | did some juggling
and clowning for a few years.

00:06:03.268 --> 00:06:04.369
Clowning?

00:06:04.369 --> 00:06:05.927
He means buffoonery.

00:06:06.271 --> 00:06:08.239
What a perfect role for him.

00:06:08.506 --> 00:06:13.068
| already knew this, Al-kiddo,
but you really hate me, don’t you?

00:06:13.445 --> 00:06:17.215
But isn’t clowning performed
by the most skilled person in the circus?

00:06:17.215 --> 00:06:18.477
You're pretty knowledgeable.

00:06:18.717 --> 00:06:21.379
If you were that good, why did you quit?

00:06:21.686 --> 00:06:22.744
Why?

00:06:23.188 --> 00:06:25.723
That’s because when it comes
to entertaining an audience,

00:06:25.724 --> 00:06:28.093
| learned that dancing
while undressing yourself would pay mo—

00:06:28.093 --> 00:06:29.327
O-ow, OW, OW, OW...

00:06:29.327 --> 00:06:30.794
Shut up and watch.
O-ow, OW, OW, OW...

00:06:33.565 --> 00:06:37.797
Looks like you’ve found the parts you like.

00:06:40.005 --> 00:06:44.505
This guy never talks about his past, either, huh?

00:06:44.609 --> 00:06:45.701
It gets on my nerves.

00:06:48.246 --> 00:06:52.746
Now, the final performance will be this astonishing
illusion presented by me, the ringmaster.

00:06:53.618 --> 00:06:55.051
Please enjoy.

00:06:55.287 --> 00:06:58.051
| bet you took this job because of that woman.

00:06:58.323 --> 00:06:59.654
Isn’t she gorgeous?

00:06:59.891 --> 00:07:01.859
But she never lets her guard down.

00:07:04.296 --> 00:07:09.233
Now, will someone from the audience
please assist me?

00:07:11.169 --> 00:07:14.661
Young boy over there,
please come down to the stage.

00:07:15.941 --> 00:07:17.670
Huh? M-me’?

00:07:32.924 --> 00:07:34.191
What’s your name?

00:07:34.192 --> 00:07:35.216
Romario!

00:07:35.393 --> 00:07:36.382
Pleased to meet you.

00:07:38.263 --> 00:07:39.525
What a beautiful hand.

00:07:39.764 --> 00:07:41.891
I’m learning how to play the piano.

00:07:42.133 --> 00:07:43.657
Oh, that explains it.

00:07:43.935 --> 00:07:45.562
It must be well-trained.

00:07:46.204 --> 00:07:47.603
How wondertul.

00:07:49.841 --> 00:07:53.333
Now, Ladies and Gentlemen,
our young brave is taking on the challenge.

00:08:06.191 --> 00:08:11.219
Well, well, our clowns are way too impatient.

00:08:12.697 --> 00:08:15.894
Now, let’s see where
the young boy’s fate leads him!

00:08:22.073 --> 00:08:22.971
One...

00:08:24.109 --> 00:08:24.905
Two...

00:08:25.543 --> 00:08:26.407
Three!

00:08:51.336 --> 00:08:55.534
How strange. Where did Romario-kun go?

00:08:57.809 --> 00:09:00.903
Apparently, he already left
according to the staff...

00:09:01.146 --> 00:09:02.947
How does this kid get lost all the time?

00:09:02.947 --> 00:09:04.972
Hey, the insensitive fool right there, shut up.

00:09:05.483 --> 00:09:08.646
Let’s try backstage. I’ll ask the ringmaster.

00:09:09.120 --> 00:09:12.681
Oh my, I’m sorry to hear that.

00:09:12.957 --> 00:09:17.656
But I’m certain that | escorted Romario-kun
out to the back door myself.

00:09:17.929 --> 00:09:19.294
I see.

00:09:20.365 --> 00:09:23.129
Children require constant attention, don’t they?

00:09:24.936 --> 00:09:27.905
You're the part-time clown, aren’t you?

00:09:27.906 --> 00:09:30.466
Yes, how was my performance?

00:09:30.775 --> 00:09:34.711
You did an incredible job,
but today is your last day.

00:09:35.046 --> 00:09:35.637
Huh?

00:09:36.381 --> 00:09:38.516
I’m going to close this circus down.

00:09:38.516 --> 00:09:40.184
Huh?! Why?

00:09:40.185 --> 00:09:41.853
Because I’m going to have a child.

00:09:41.853 --> 00:09:43.721
Seriously?! You are?

00:09:43.721 --> 00:09:46.155
Wow, congratulations.

00:09:46.458 --> 00:09:47.550
Thank you.

00:09:47.725 --> 00:09:49.659
I’ve already picked out a name.

00:09:50.161 --> 00:09:51.389
It’s Viola.

00:10:00.271 --> 00:10:01.363
Well then.

00:10:01.906 --> 00:10:04.441
Let’s go, Rahzel-chan.
You can console me.

00:10:04.442 --> 00:10:05.409
Don’t be such a baby.

00:10:09.647 --> 00:10:13.048
It’s all right now.
Those people are already gone.

00:10:18.957 --> 00:10:23.792
Don’t worry. | will never let go of your hand.

00:10:44.282 --> 00:10:46.546
| wonder if she found Romario-kun already.

00:10:46.784 --> 00:10:47.876
Who knows.

00:10:48.286 --> 00:10:50.846
Maybe he’s gone home by now.

00:10:51.589 --> 00:10:53.216
| guess so...

00:10:53.758 --> 00:10:55.159
You’re spaced out.

00:10:55.160 --> 00:10:57.492
Didn’t you find the circus amusing?

00:10:57.662 --> 00:11:00.256
Huh? |I-| mean...

00:11:04.402 --> 00:11:05.300
What is it?

00:11:05.503 --> 00:11:06.731
Why are you acting shy?

00:11:07.038 --> 00:11:08.062
You’re creeping me out.

00:11:10.608 --> 00:11:11.506
What’s wrong?

00:11:12.177 --> 00:11:16.978
U-um... this is the very first time
the three of us went out just to have fun.

00:11:17.315 --> 00:11:18.543
How can | put it?

00:11:19.017 --> 00:11:21.008
I’m really happy.

00:11:21.319 --> 00:11:22.718
You're welcome.

00:11:40.138 --> 00:11:42.868
What’s that idiot up to?

00:11:43.041 --> 00:11:44.736
Enough grumbling.

00:11:45.843 --> 00:11:47.674
So, what do we do?

00:11:48.279 --> 00:11:52.739
Oh... Right, | knew it.

00:12:11.536 --> 00:12:13.697
She hasn’t found him yet after all.

00:12:14.272 --> 00:12:18.106
At this point, he’s more likely kidnapped than lost.

00:12:25.016 --> 00:12:27.576
Excuse me for intruding.

00:12:45.003 --> 00:12:47.870
Don't scare me, Idiot!

00:12:49.641 --> 00:12:51.404
| only defended myself, right?

00:12:51.909 --> 00:12:52.898
Welcome.

00:12:53.745 --> 00:12:56.236
How may | help you this late at night?

00:12:56.881 --> 00:12:58.682
I’m here to look for Romario-kun.

00:12:58.683 --> 00:13:00.310
Oh, that boy?

00:13:00.652 --> 00:13:02.950
He has such wonderful hands.

00:13:03.221 --> 00:13:04.711
So, you do know where he is.

00:13:05.523 --> 00:13:06.820
Don’t be so hasty.

00:13:07.158 --> 00:13:09.023
rll let you see him now.

00:13:18.736 --> 00:13:20.104
What is this?

00:13:20.104 --> 00:13:22.039
Take a close look at the hands.

00:13:22.040 --> 00:13:22.529
The hands?

00:13:25.243 --> 00:13:27.040
It really is a shame.

00:13:27.345 --> 00:13:31.475
| had high hopes for him, but everything
except for his hands were completely useless.

00:13:32.250 --> 00:13:35.686
| was hoping to get
the remaining parts from him, too.

00:13:38.589 --> 00:13:39.886
That can’t be...

00:13:41.526 --> 00:13:47.931
| was supposed to have a child,
but it lost its life inside me.

00:13:48.833 --> 00:13:50.528
It was a natural miscarriage.

00:13:51.069 --> 00:13:54.664
It seemed as if God sent a message
that it must not be born.

00:13:55.273 --> 00:13:56.968
Isn't that unfair?

00:13:57.608 --> 00:14:01.408
Shouldn’t my child have the right to happiness?

00:14:01.679 --> 00:14:06.241
Its pitiable soul must be devastated,
still being stranded inside me...

00:14:06.651 --> 00:14:09.520
so | must offer the best possible body for this child.

00:14:09.520 --> 00:14:12.114
That’s indeed what a mother would do.

00:14:13.658 --> 00:14:15.660
Do you not agree?

00:14:15.660 --> 00:14:16.752
Of course not!

00:14:17.028 --> 00:14:23.160
And yet, that mother let go of her child’s hand,
as if she no longer wanted him.

00:14:23.835 --> 00:14:28.363
No longer wanted... Letting go of his hand...

00:14:29.741 --> 00:14:38.171
Exactly. So, that boy will be reborn
as my precious child. He’ll be part of Viola!

00:14:38.449 --> 00:14:42.044
Unfortunately, your body parts
don’t look like a good fit for her.

00:14:42.653 --> 00:14:45.022
| hope you at least enjoy the circus.

00:14:45.022 --> 00:14:48.719
Just be warned that the nighttime performance
might be a bit scary.

00:15:06.077 --> 00:15:09.280
Oh, you’re a sorcerer, huh?

00:15:09.280 --> 00:15:10.214
How nice.

00:15:10.214 --> 00:15:12.546
Oh, I’m flattered.

00:15:13.818 --> 00:15:16.013
What? How come it didn’t work?

00:15:45.416 --> 00:15:46.474
Alzeid!

00:15:47.518 --> 00:15:48.985
Heat-tan is here, too!

00:15:49.353 --> 00:15:50.581
What are you doing here?

00:15:50.788 --> 00:15:55.487
Wherever you are, I’d go through
fire and water for you, Rahzel-chan.

00:15:56.227 --> 00:15:58.218
But you need to learn a lesson, okay?

00:15:59.730 --> 00:16:02.221
Your independent action isn’t acceptable.

00:16:02.900 --> 00:16:05.460
You couldn’t even ask us to come along?

00:16:06.103 --> 00:16:06.797
Wha—

00:16:09.440 --> 00:16:11.533
Who asked you to worry about me?

00:16:11.676 --> 00:16:14.144
Butting in like this with your noses in the air.

00:16:15.146 --> 00:16:16.238
Come closer.

00:16:17.081 --> 00:16:19.515
Thanks, | couldn’t be happier.

00:16:21.319 --> 00:16:23.412
| know you are, Idiot.

00:16:23.821 --> 00:16:26.119
Alright, shall we enjoy the circus, then?

00:16:26.457 --> 00:16:27.651
The three of us together.

00:16:29.260 --> 00:16:32.229
How lucky we are to get
to see the show for free.

00:16:32.530 --> 00:16:36.933
We're not just seeing it.
We're getting forced to take part.

00:16:46.377 --> 00:16:49.938
What?! Aiming from up there?!
What a cheap shot!

00:16:50.181 --> 00:16:53.082
Precisely! Let’s drag him down right away!

00:16:53.251 --> 00:16:55.185
You two have a great chemistry.

00:16:55.353 --> 00:16:58.413
Behold. Let me present the balancing act
on a ladder with no support.

00:17:04.362 --> 00:17:06.091
Freestanding ladder!

00:17:09.066 --> 00:17:11.796
That’s awesome! Way to go, Idiot King!

00:17:11.903 --> 00:17:13.302
Is that supposed to be a compliment?

00:17:14.539 --> 00:17:16.006
So creepy.

00:17:16.407 --> 00:17:18.272
No matter how many times we defeat them,
they get right back up.

00:17:19.877 --> 00:17:21.003
You suck!

00:17:31.622 --> 00:17:35.353
What the hell? It’s made of wood,
or some kind of resin?

00:17:35.960 --> 00:17:40.920
I don’t know how this mechanism works,
but apparently they are all dolls.

00:17:41.098 --> 00:17:43.430
Is that woman a sorcerer or something, too?

00:17:44.035 --> 00:17:47.766
That’s right. The clowns
are manipulated by sorcery.

00:17:48.940 --> 00:17:51.602
But it isn’t by my power.

00:17:54.178 --> 00:17:57.681
Yes, the sorcerer is right here.

00:17:57.682 --> 00:17:58.910
Viola.

00:17:59.116 --> 00:18:01.107
Now, Viola...

00:18:01.285 --> 00:18:06.245
| know having your body unfinished
is hard for you, but please, protect your mother.

00:18:28.412 --> 00:18:30.710
Yes, Viola, that’s it!

00:18:34.719 --> 00:18:35.708
N-no.

00:18:35.920 --> 00:18:38.218
No... No! No!

00:18:38.556 --> 00:18:39.614
Stop!

00:18:42.693 --> 00:18:44.320
What’s wrong, Viola?

00:18:44.562 --> 00:18:46.996
Finish it with your own hands!

00:18:54.872 --> 00:18:57.102
Wh-what’s the idea, Viola?

00:18:57.441 --> 00:18:59.068
Don’t you know your own mother?

00:18:59.276 --> 00:19:01.744
Viola! Viola!

00:19:03.547 --> 00:19:05.412
It’s just a doll after all.

00:19:07.585 --> 00:19:11.919
When you said stop,
it stopped manipulating us with sorcery.

00:19:12.256 --> 00:19:14.424
When it was told to finish it with its own hands,

00:19:14.425 --> 00:19:19.886
it tried to kill the woman who happened
to be close to it, literally with its own hands.

00:19:20.364 --> 00:19:22.298
It’s merely reacting to the commands.

00:19:22.566 --> 00:19:25.034
It doesn’t matter who the target is.

00:19:26.370 --> 00:19:27.268
Does that mean...

00:19:27.672 --> 00:19:34.236
Right. That woman should’ve commanded it
to release her and save her.

00:19:38.683 --> 00:19:39.513
Alzeid?

00:19:40.885 --> 00:19:41.874
Alzeid!

00:19:42.553 --> 00:19:43.542
Baroqueheat!

00:19:45.289 --> 00:19:47.189
Don’t look at it if you don’t want to.

00:19:47.792 --> 00:19:52.388
Just close your eyes and cover your ears,
and pretend as if nothing happened.

00:19:52.730 --> 00:19:57.230
It’s neither a human nor an animal,
not even a mindless doll.

00:19:58.002 --> 00:20:00.027
It’s nothing but a pitiful cloned soul.

00:20:00.571 --> 00:20:02.869
It shouldn’t have been born in the first place.

00:20:03.140 --> 00:20:05.267
That’s not what others can decide, is it?

00:20:05.543 --> 00:20:07.977
| mean, it has already been born.

00:20:08.379 --> 00:20:12.247
It’s just a patched-together monster,
with no life to live.

00:20:12.616 --> 00:20:15.452
It’s not something you should
be concerned with, Rahzel-chan.

00:20:15.453 --> 00:20:16.818
Shut up, you thug!

00:20:18.155 --> 00:20:19.417
Then, what is life?

00:20:19.690 --> 00:20:22.454
How would | determine
what’s real and what’s not?

00:20:22.660 --> 00:20:25.788
Am | wrong? What should | do, then?

00:20:25.996 --> 00:20:28.331
| don’t know what the right thing is anymore.

00:20:28.332 --> 00:20:30.267
But | don’t want it! | don’t!

00:20:30.267 --> 00:20:31.165
Because...

00:20:35.072 --> 00:20:41.170
Because to me, it looked like
nothing more than a crying child.

00:20:46.650 --> 00:20:53.852
Shortly after, the circus that had lost its master
vanished into thin air, along with its lifeless clowns.

00:20:54.959 --> 00:21:02.127
Those who let go of something precious to them
will keep waiting there eternally.

00:21:06.937 --> 00:21:08.996
Are you still moping?

00:21:12.777 --> 00:21:14.244
So what?

00:21:14.645 --> 00:21:17.705
Let’s go have some fun.
Hurry up and get ready.

00:21:18.983 --> 00:21:20.143
Have fun?

00:21:21.919 --> 00:21:23.352
We'll have fun.

00:21:24.455 --> 00:21:26.047
The three of us?

00:21:26.357 --> 00:21:28.552
Yeah, the three of us.

00:21:29.593 --> 00:21:32.323
Sure. Count me in!

00:21:43.674 --> 00:21:47.344
Tonari no heya kara

00:21:47.344 --> 00:21:50.973
Waraigoe ga suru

00:21:51.148 --> 00:21:58.350
Ussura mezameru asa ga konna ni Itoshii

00:21:58.722 --> 00:22:05.958
Dokoka de yumemita ichimai no e ni wa

00:22:06.230 --> 00:22:13.534
Mou anata no isu wo kakitashita bakari da yo

00:22:13.704 --> 00:22:18.204
Kanashii monogatari ga ima

00:22:20.644 --> 00:22:29.348
Curtain no mukogawa machibuse shite itemo

00:22:31.355 --> 00:22:38.591
Ashita ni wa mishiranu hito no yoni nattemo

00:22:38.863 --> 00:22:45.996
Anata ga koko ni iru tashika na kiseki wo shinjite

00:22:46.303 --> 00:22:53.641
Sashidasareta te ni wa wakare no yokan mo naku

00:22:53.978 --> 00:23:01.714
Tada dakishimetakute ima ruisen ga yurunda
